# Stray main-process bundle occasionally emitted at the app root instead of
# out/main/index.js (the path package.json's "main" field actually points
# to). Nothing loads it from here, but keep it out of git status if a build
# re-emits it; this does not stop electron-builder from packaging it, since
# it globs its own "files" list rather than reading .gitignore.
/index.js
